; LxProbe 0.3: PsiLinux's hardware probes (a test program, not a release).
; Runs the probes and writes D:\LxProbe.log (C:\LxProbe.log without a card).
; With a file D:\LXDBT.TXT present, only the Alpine-mode probes run
; (alignment faults, the code cache, a thread's registers).
&EN
#{"LxProbe"},(0x0100FA12),0,3,0
"lxprobe.app"-"!:\System\Apps\LxProbe\LxProbe.app"
"lxprobe.rsc"-"!:\System\Apps\LxProbe\LxProbe.rsc"
"lxprobe.exe"-"!:\System\Apps\LxProbe\lxprobe.exe"
